          "filename": "Canning Dock - geograph.org.uk - 1158953.jpg",
          "caption": "Canning Dock A view of Canning Dock towards the dock gates that link it with Canning Half Tide Dock.  Above and beyond the gates the skeleton of the new Merseyside Maritime Museum can be seen.  It is due to open in 2010.  To the right of the dock gates the entrances to two dry docks can be seen, and, to the right again, the famous Pier Head buildings.",
